## Scenario

The mail and notification centre of a Tuff account: plugin review results, CI builds, sign-in alerts, channel mentions, releases and statements all land here. Hundreds of messages have to be skimmable, keyboard-driven and answerable in place, and new mail must not interrupt what is being read. The notification center takes the other road: no reader pane, and every notice carries its own quick action, so the list itself is where things get done.

It fits any "list + reader" interface: a notification centre, ticket and review queues, a support inbox.

